## Phase 5: Meridian UI Replication *(~6 hours)*

**Goal:** Replace the temporary UI with the polished Meridian design. All 11 pages, every visual detail, using the working backend from Phases 1-4.

### 5.1 — Approach

1. Extract CSS design tokens from Meridian HTML (lines 14-390) → `tokens.css`
2. Extract Icon system (lines 909-967) → `Icon.tsx` + `ICN` constants
3. Port each Meridian component one-by-one, replacing mock data reads with API calls
